      "side": 1,
      "message": "My thinking was that once mmap_lock is acquired, we should make some progress before releasing the lock due to contention. That\u0027s why I checked for `copied`. Otherwise, at least theoretically, it is possible that copy operation may keep returning -EAGAIN without making any progress. WDYT?\n\nPlease let me know if you think it should be without `copied` check. I\u0027ll change the code in next patch in that case.",
